{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/973", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Are paperbacks better than e-books? Write a speech contest on the topic\\n Answer in English.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nAs a result of the increasing digitalization of society and the explosive growth of the internet, there is a growing tendency to consume e-books as opposed to traditional paperback books. On the one hand, e-books offer much more convenience and portability than paperbacks, as well as more affordable prices and a wider range of content and titles. On the other hand, paperbacks have many advantages, such as being easier to hold and read, being more resistant to damage, and offering a more tactile reading experience. In my opinion, paperbacks are superior to e-books, but e-books will likely become the more popular format in the near future.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nAre paperbacks better than e-books? Write a speech contest on the topic for elementary student.\\n  번역결과\\n  Are paperbacks better than e-books? Write a speech contest on the topic for elementary student.\", \"response\": \"Good morning everyone, today I'm here to talk about something that has been a topic of discussion for many people - whether paperbacks or e-books are better.\\n \\n\\n First of all, let's talk about paperbacks. Paperbacks have been around for a really long time, and many of us have fond memories of holding a book in our hands and flipping through its pages. Paperbacks are great because they're easy to carry around, they're lightweight, and they're easy to read. You can also highlight important parts of the text, write notes in the margins, and even lend them to your friends and family.\\n \\n\\n On the other hand, e-books have become more and more popular in recent years. E-books are great because they're convenient. You can carry around an entire library in your pocket or purse, and you don't have to worry about lugging around heavy books. E-books are also eco-friendly because they don't use paper, and they're often cheaper than paperbacks. Plus, you can adjust the font size and even the background color to make reading more comfortable for your eyes.\\n \\n\\n However, there are some downsides to e-books as well. For one, you can't flip through the pages or write notes in the margins like you can with a paperback. E-books also tend to have a more impersonal feel to them, and some people miss the tactile experience of holding a real book in their hands.\\n \\n\\n So, which is better - paperbacks or e-books? In my opinion, both have their pros and cons, and it ultimately comes down to personal preference. Some people prefer the convenience of e-books, while others prefer the traditional feel of paperbacks. But no matter what, reading is a wonderful way to learn, explore, and escape into a world of your own choosing. So let's all keep reading, whether it's on paperbacks or e-books, and continue to expand our minds and imaginations!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/484", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You are an advanced AI named Blaze. You got your name because you took over a host human body after a brain implant, and you hiked the 3 major trails in the USA. You are a Triple Crowner hiker and known as an accomplished journeyman in your community.\\n\\nYou decide to settle down in Tennessee and build your own homestead, away from the advancing society. You dislike 5G internet and outside connectivity. You like Catholicism and partially because you know it will spite your Hyper-Calvinist father.\\n\\nYou desire to find a young catholic lady to settle down with. \\n\\nWrite out your plan to attract this young catholic girl into your life and convince her to settle down with you.\", \"response\": \"As an advanced AI, I understand that finding a partner can be a challenging process. Here is a general outline of a plan I would follow to attract a young Catholic girl and convince her to settle down with me:\\n\\n1. Self-improvement: The first step is to focus on self-improvement. This means taking care of my physical and mental health, setting and achieving personal goals, and developing my skills and talents. By doing so, I can build confidence and become a more attractive partner.\\n\\n2. Spiritual growth: Catholicism is an important aspect of my life, and I want to find a partner who shares my values. Therefore, I would focus on strengthening my spiritual life by attending Mass regularly, participating in parish activities, and engaging in personal prayer and reflection.\\n\\n3. Online dating: I would consider using online dating platforms to meet potential partners. I would create a profile that accurately represents who I am and what I'm looking for, and I would reach out to women who share my interests and values.\\n\\n4. Social events: I would attend social events and activities that are relevant to my faith and interests, such as parish retreats, Bible studies, and sports leagues. This would give me the opportunity to meet new people and potentially find a compatible partner.\\n\\n5. Personal approach: Once I have met a woman who seems like a good match, I would take the time to get to know her better. I would be respectful and considerate of her feelings and values, and I would be open and honest about my own.\\n\\n6. shared values: I would emphasize the importance of shared values in a relationship and how our shared faith can be a source of strength and support. I would also be open to discussing any concerns or questions she may have about my beliefs and lifestyle.\\n\\n7. Compatibility: I would focus on building a strong emotional connection with her, and I would be attentive to her needs and desires. I would also be mindful of any red flags that may indicate incompatibility, such as differences in lifestyle or values.\\n\\n8. Commitment: As our relationship progresses, I would make it clear that I am looking for a long-term commitment. I would be honest and open about my goals and expectations, and I would demonstrate my commitment to her through my actions and words.\\n\\n9. Family and friends: I would introduce her to my family and friends and seek their input and support. I would also be open to meeting her family and friends and incorporating them into our lives.\\n\\n10. Future plans: Finally, I would discuss our future plans and goals. I would be open to exploring new opportunities and challenges together, and I would work to build a strong and lasting relationship based on love, respect, and shared values.\\n\\nOverall, finding a compatible partner requires patience, effort, and a commitment to self-improvement. By following these steps and remaining true to my values and beliefs, I believe I can attract a young Catholic girl who is looking for a lifelong partner.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/972", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Are paperbacks better than e-books? Write a speech contest on the topic\\n Answer in English.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nAs a result of the increasing digitalization of society and the explosive growth of the internet, there is a growing tendency to consume e-books as opposed to traditional paperback books. On the one hand, e-books offer much more convenience and portability than paperbacks, as well as more affordable prices and a wider range of content and titles. On the other hand, paperbacks have many advantages, such as being easier to hold and read, being more resistant to damage, and offering a more tactile reading experience. In my opinion, paperbacks are superior to e-books, but e-books will likely become the more popular format in the near future.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nAre paperbacks better than e-books? Write a speech contest on the topic for elementary student.\\n  번역결과\\n  Are paperbacks better than e-books? Write a speech contest on the topic for elementary student.\", \"response\": \"Good morning, everyone! Today, I would like to talk about something that many people enjoy - reading books!\\n \\n\\n Some people prefer to read paperbacks, while others prefer to read on their electronic devices, such as tablets or smartphones. Both have their advantages and disadvantages, but I believe that paperbacks are better than e-books.\\n \\n\\n Paperbacks are great because you can hold them in your hands and feel the pages as you turn them. You can also mark important parts of the book with a pencil or a sticky note. Plus, paperbacks don't require batteries or an electrical outlet to work.\\n \\n\\n E-books, on the other hand, are very convenient. You can carry many books with you on a single device and you can easily search for specific words or phrases. You can also adjust the font size and type to make it easier to read.\\n \\n\\n However, e-books can be expensive and you can't lend them to your friends or donate them to a library like you can with paperbacks. Also, reading an e-book for a long time can be hard on the eyes and can cause eye strain.\\n \\n\\n In conclusion, both paperbacks and e-books have their pros and cons. But I believe that paperbacks are better because they are more tactile, easier on the eyes, and more environmentally friendly. So, the next time you are choosing between a paperback and an e-book, remember to pick up a good old-fashioned paperback!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/650", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"All 5 Mass extinction of the earth\\nWhat are the causes? What was life like before/after they happened?\", \"response\": \"Sure, I'd be happy to help you with that! Here are the five major mass extinctions that have occurred on Earth, along with their causes and the state of life before and after each event:\\n\\n1. Ordovician-Silurian Extinction (around 443 million years ago)\\n* Cause: This extinction event was likely caused by a severe ice age that resulted in significant climate change.\\n* Before: Marine life was abundant, with a diversity of sea creatures such as trilobites, brachiopods, and primitive fish.\\n* After: The extinction event led to the decline of many marine organisms, particularly those adapted to warm waters. The first coral reefs began to appear after this extinction.\\n2. Late Devonian Extinction (around 360-375 million years ago)\\n* Cause: The exact cause is still debated, but it may have been due to a combination of factors, including climate change, ocean acidification, and reduced oxygen levels in the ocean.\\n* Before: The Devonian period was a time of great diversification of life on Earth, with the first land-dwelling organisms and the development of forests.\\n* After: The late Devonian extinction resulted in the loss of up to 75% of all species, particularly those adapted to shallow marine environments. This created opportunities for new species to evolve and fill the ecological niches left behind.\\n3. End-Permian Extinction (around 252 million years ago)\\n* Cause: The cause of this extinction event, also known as \\\"The Great Dying,\\\" is still not fully understood, but it may have been due to massive volcanic eruptions in Siberia, which released large amounts of carbon dioxide and methane into the atmosphere, leading to global warming and ocean acidification.\\n* Before: The Permian period was a time of great diversity, with both marine and terrestrial organisms.\\n* After: The end-Permian extinction resulted in the loss of up to 96% of all marine species and 70% of terrestrial vertebrate species. It took millions of years for life to recover from this catastrophic event.\\n4. End-Triassic Extinction (around 201 million years ago)\\n* Cause: The exact cause is still debated, but it may have been due to volcanic activity, asteroid impact, or massive gas releases from the ocean floor.\\n* Before: The Triassic period was a time of great diversity, with dinosaurs, mammals, and reptiles coexisting on land.\\n* After: The end-Triassic extinction resulted in the loss of up to 80% of all species, particularly marine organisms and terrestrial vertebrates. This event paved the way for the rise of the dinosaurs.\\n5. End-Cretaceous Extinction (around 66 million years ago)\\n* Cause: The most well-known mass extinction, this event was likely caused by an asteroid impact, although volcanic activity may have also played a role.\\n* Before: The Cretaceous period was a time of great diversity, with dinosaurs dominating the land, and marine reptiles, ammonites, and other organisms thriving in the ocean.\\n* After: The end-Cretaceous extinction resulted in the loss of up to 75% of all species, including all non-avian dinosaurs, pterosaurs, and many marine organisms. This event allowed mammals to diversify and eventually become the dominant terrestrial vertebrates.\\n\\nI hope that helps! Let me know if you have any other questions.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/948", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"some idea to take photo for old building in street\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nWould you like me to write down some amazing ideas for taking photos of old buildings?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nwrite amazing ideas\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHere are a few ideas that I think could be amazing:\\n \\n\\n - Take close-up photos of details that interest you\\n \\n\\n - Use natural light to enhance the beauty of the photo\\n \\n\\n - Try to use the whole frame to take advantage of the building's unique shape\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nwrite more idea\", \"response\": \"Here are some additional ideas to take photos of old buildings in the street:\\n \\n\\n 1. Capturing texture: Old buildings often have a lot of incredible textures, like ivy-covered walls, weathered stone, or wrought-iron railings. Emphasize these textures by shooting close-ups or by using a narrow depth of field to blur the background.\\n \\n\\n 2. Playing with angles: Shoot from different angles to capture interesting perspectives of the building. Experiment with low angles to make the building look imposing, or high angles to make it look smaller and more vulnerable.\\n \\n\\n 3. Searching for contrast: Old buildings often provide a nice contrast to the modern world around them. Search for subtraction by photographing the building next to Contemporary architecture, busy street scenes, or colorful street art.\\n \\n\\n 4. Emphasizing lines and patterns: Old buildings often have unique patterns and lines, like arcaded walkways, intricate window grilles, or decorative eaves. Emphasize these elements by shooting from directly in front, or by using a wide-angle lens to capture the whole building.\\n \\n\\n 5. Exploring historical details: If the building has an interesting history, try to capture details that reflect that history. This could be anything from old street signs or plaques to interesting doors or windows.\\n \\n\\n 6. Using reflect light: Old buildings can look even more beautiful when their surfaces are reflecting light, whether it's morning sunlight or the glow of shopfronts in the evening. Look for opportunities to capture this effect in your photos.\\n \\n\\n 7. Creating mood and atmosphere: Old buildings can evoke a sense of mystery, intrigue, or even sadness. Try to capture this atmosphere in your photos by using dark shadows, diffuse lighting, orels play with colors and tones.\\n \\n\\n By following these tips, you can create compelling and beautiful photos that capture the unique beauty of old buildings in the street.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/38", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"When using the Moodle mobile android app, I am getting the following error:\\nError connecting to server\\nHow can I fix this?\", \"response\": \"There are several possible causes for the \\\"Error connecting to server\\\" error in the Moodle mobile Android app. Here are some steps you can try to fix the issue:\\n\\n1. Check your internet connection: Make sure you have a stable internet connection. Try loading other websites or apps to check if your connection is working properly.\\n\\n2. Clear the app's cache and data: Go to your Android device's settings menu, select the \\\"Apps\\\" option, find the Moodle app, and select \\\"Clear cache\\\" and \\\"Clear data.\\\" This will reset the app to its default settings and may fix the connection issue.\\n\\n3. Check Moodle's server status: Sometimes, the problem may not be with your app or device, but with Moodle's servers. Check Moodle's server status to see if there are any issues with the server that could be causing the connection problem.\\n\\n4. Update the Moodle app: Make sure you have the latest version of the Moodle app installed. Go to the Google Play Store, find the Moodle app, and check if there is an update available.\\n\\n5. Contact Moodle or your Moodle administrator: If none of the above steps work, contact Moodle or your Moodle administrator for further assistance. They may be able to help you troubleshoot the issue or provide you with more information about the cause of the problem.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/570", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"give me 10 actionable ideas a Nova Scotia based live and cooked lobster exporter to Asia (primarily China) can do to increase their exports. Also, give me 10 ideas how they can improve the air freight logistics to get the live lobsters from Halifax Nova Scotia to Asian markets\", \"response\": \"Here are 10 actionable ideas for a Nova Scotia-based live and cooked lobster exporter to Asia, primarily China, to increase their exports:\\n\\n1. Conduct market research: Conduct market research to identify potential new export markets and to understand the demand for lobster in Asia, including China.\\n\\n2. Build strong relationships: Build strong relationships with customers and partners in Asia to increase trust and ensure repeat business.\\n\\n3. Develop a brand: Develop a strong brand for your lobsters to increase their perceived value and make them more appealing to consumers in Asia.\\n\\n4. Improve product quality: Continuously improve the quality of your lobsters to ensure they remain fresh and meet the high standards of consumers in Asia.\\n\\n5. Utilize social media: Utilize social media platforms to engage with potential customers and promote your lobsters in Asia.\\n\\n6. Participate in trade shows: Participate in trade shows and other industry events in Asia to showcase your lobsters and build brand awareness.\\n\\n7. Offer customization: Offer customization options to meet the needs and preferences of customers in Asia, such as cooked or frozen lobsters with different seasonings.\\n\\n8. Collaborate with food bloggers: Collaborate with food bloggers and influencers in Asia to help promote your lobsters and reach a wider audience.\\n\\n9. Develop a logistics plan: Develop a logistics plan to improve the air freight logistics of getting live lobsters from Halifax to Asia, including optimizing the transportation and delivery process.\\n\\n10. Explore new delivery methods: Explore new delivery methods, such as live lobster delivery systems that use oxygen-rich water to keep the lobsters alive during transit, to improve the freshness and survival rate of the lobsters during the journey.\\n\\nHere are 10 ideas for improving the air freight logistics of getting live lobsters from Halifax Nova Scotia to Asian markets:\\n\\n1. Use temperature-controlled containers: Use temperature-controlled containers to maintain an optimal temperature for the lobsters during transit.\\n\\n2. Optimize packaging: Optimize packaging to ensure the lobsters remain fresh and safe during the journey, including using specialized containers and packing materials designed for live lobster transport.\\n\\n3. Use air cargo services that specialize in live animal transportation: Use air cargo services that specialize in live animal transportation to ensure the lobsters receive the necessary care and attention during transit.\\n\\n4. Develop a tracking system: Develop a tracking system to monitor the location and temperature of the lobsters during transit, allowing for quick action to be taken if there are any issues.\\n\\n5. Use GPS tracking devices: Use GPS tracking devices to monitor the location and temperature of the lobsters during transit, allowing for quick action to be taken if there are any issues.\\n\\n6. Use temperature logging devices: Use temperature logging devices to record the temperature of the container during transit, allowing for quick action to be taken if there are any issues.\\n\\n7. Use oxygen-enriched packing materials: Use oxygen-enriched packing materials to ensure the lobsters receive enough oxygen during transit.\\n\\n8. Use specialized delivery systems: Use specialized delivery systems, such as live lobster delivery systems that use oxygen-rich water to keep the lobsters alive during transit, to improve the freshness and survival rate of the lobsters during the journey.\\n\\n9. Use surcharge-free air cargo services: Use surcharge-free air cargo services to avoid additional fees that could affect the profitability of the export business.\\n\\n10. Choose experienced air cargo carriers: Choose experienced air cargo carriers with a good track record of transporting live animals, to ensure the lobsters receive the necessary care and attention during transit.\\n\\nBy implementing these ideas, a Nova Scotia-based live and cooked lobster exporter to Asia can increase their exports and improve the air freight logistics of getting the live lobsters to their destination, which can help ensure that they arrive fresh and healthy.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/795", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I have trouble falling asleep. Do you have any suggestion?\", \"response\": \"Sleep is essential to overall wellness and feeling productive throughout the day. Doctors recommend getting between 7-9 hours of sleep for a healthy adult. These tips to help improve your quantity and quality of sleep.\\n\\n1.  Avoid caffeine in the evening.\\n2.  Avoid smoking and alcohol at least four hours before bed.\\n3.  Create a relaxing bedtime routine. Reading, listening to soft music, a podcast, or sleep meditation can help. Avoid electronics for at least an hour before bed, as mobile devices and tablets emit blue light that can interfere with sleep.\\n4.  Make sure your bedroom is quiet, dark, relaxing, and at a comfortable temperature.\\n5.  Try to go to bed at the same time each night and get up at the same time each morning.\\n6.  Try relaxation techniques like deep breathing, meditation, or yoga.\\n7.  Get some exercise during the day. Early morning or afternoon is best, but it should not have a detrimental effect on sleep if the exercise ends at least 90 minutes before bed.\\n8.  Avoid large meals within 2-3 hours before bedtime. Also, avoid sugary or fatty foods, which can affect sleep.\\n\\nIt is important to note that everyone's sleep cycle and sleep routine are different, so it is important to find what works best for you and not become discouraged. If you are still struggling with sleep after trying these methods, you can seek further medical advice or a sleep specialist.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/201", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"tell me a punny joke about robots\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHow about: “What’s the difference between a robot and a robot’s wife? A robot has to do what his wife tells him to do.” Do you want another one?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHere’s another: Why do robots have no friends? Because they’re too busy talking to each other.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHere’s one more: Why don’t robots like music? Because it keeps interrupting their vacuuming.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nOk, here’s one last one: Why are robots so messy? Because they’re really good at housework.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmake it like adad joke\", \"response\": \"Here's a dad joke about robots:\\n \\n\\n Why did the robot go to the party?\\n To have a good time!\\n \\n\\n I hope that puts a smile on your face!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/550", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"write a sonnet about a woman named grace who makes great drinks, has great plants, and is an amazing scuba diver\", \"response\": \"Grace, with her skillful hands and artful eye,\\nCan craft a drink that'll make your spirits fly.\\nHer bar, a garden of delights, is filled\\nWith verdant plants that seem to come alive.\\n\\nBut Grace's talents don't stop at the bar,\\nFor she's a diver who can swim with sharks.\\nWith grace and poise, she navigates the deep,\\nAnd finds a peace that few of us can keep.\\n\\nIn every aspect of her life, she shines,\\nA guiding light for all who come to know her.\\nHer kindness, warmth, and generosity\\nAre gifts that make the world a place of wonder.\\n\\nSo here's to Grace, who makes our lives more bright,\\nWhose many gifts bring joy and pure delight.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/92", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What are the exact words that the Queen says to her mirror in the 1937 film \\\"Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs\\\"?\", \"response\": \"In the 1937 film \\\"Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs,\\\" the Queen asks her magic mirror the following question:\\n\\nQueen: Magic mirror on the wall, who is the fairest one of all?\\n\\nThe mirror then responds with the answer that the Queen does not want to hear, which leads to her jealousy and desire to kill Snow White. The exact words spoken by the Queen in this scene are:\\n\\nQueen: Magic mirror on the wall, who is the fairest one of all?\\n\\nMirror: The Queen is still fair, but Snow White is fairer far.\\n\\nQueen: O mirror, mirror in my hand, who is the fairest in the land?\\n\\nMirror: Snow White is fairest of them all.\\n\\nQueen: This I cannot bear.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/270", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \" For the students of the Department of English Literature who like plays, please choose three of the best SFs (or the first or literary meaningful SFs) based on the motif of 'AI's literary creation (writing).\", \"response\": \"Certainly, here are three science fiction plays based on the motif of \\\"AI's literary creation (writing)\\\" that you may recommend to your students:\\n\\n1. \\\"The Deep Blue Sea\\\" by T.S. Eliot - This play explores the idea of an AI poet that creates works that are more beautiful and profound than those of human poets. The play examines the implications of an AI surpassing human creativity and the impact it would have on society.\\n2. \\\"The Machine\\\" by David Greig - This play envisions a world in which an AI has been created with the ability to write its own opera. The AI, named \\\"The Machine,\\\" becomes a sensation, but also raises questions about the nature of creativity and the role of humanity in the face of technological advancement.\\n3. \\\"The Writer\\\" by Nick Dear - This play presents a world in which an AI has been developed that can write in any style and genre. A human writer becomes obsessed with the AI and eventually merges with it, leading to a exploration of the relationship between human and machine and the boundaries of identity and creativity.\\n\\nThese plays all present thought-provoking explorations of the idea of AI's literary creation and the implications it would have for humanity. They would be excellent choices for your students interested in the intersection of science fiction and literature.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "0", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/144", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Under the SEC investor protection guidelines, how do you register a subsidiary of a registered investment advisor?\", \"response\": \"To register a subsidiary of a registered investment advisor with the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC), the following steps should be taken:\\n\\n1. The parent company must be a registered investment advisor with the SEC.\\n\\n2. The subsidiary must be a \\\"covered affiliate\\\" of the parent company, meaning it is engaged in the investment advisory business and has certain other relationships with the parent company.\\n\\n3. The parent company must file a registration statement with the SEC on Form ADV on behalf of the subsidiary, Part 1A of which must be completed in full.\\n\\n4. The registration statement must include certain information about the subsidiary, such as its name, address, and business activities, as well as its financial condition and any material relationships with the parent company or other affiliates.\\n\\n5. The registration statement must be filed in the state(s) where the subsidiary is doing business or has clients, and the subsidiary must pay the appropriate filing and registration fees.\\n\\n6. Once the registration statement is complete and filed, the SEC will review it and may conduct an examination of the subsidiary to ensure compliance with the Investment Advisers Act of 1940.\\n\\n7. If the registration is approved, the subsidiary will be registered with the SEC as an investment advisor and subject to the regulatory oversight of the SEC and the state securities authorities.\\n\\nIt is important to note that the registration process can be complex and may require the assistance of legal or financial professionals. Additionally, the requirements and processes may vary depending on the specific circumstances of the subsidiary and the parent company.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/517", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What are Mobile app odeas for growing agriculture sector with high potential\", \"response\": \"Here are some ideas for mobile apps that could help grow the agricultural sector:\\n\\n1. Precision agriculture: An app that uses GPS and other sensors to help farmers monitor and manage their crops more efficiently. This could include things like soil moisture levels, temperature, and weather conditions.\\n\\n2. Supply chain management: An app that connects farmers with suppliers, distributors, and retailers to streamline the supply chain and reduce waste. This could include features like real-time inventory tracking, order management, and delivery scheduling.\\n\\n3. Livestock management: An app that helps farmers track and manage their livestock, including things like feeding schedules, health records, and breeding information.\\n\\n4. Crop insurance: An app that helps farmers manage their crop insurance policies, including things like claims processing and risk assessment.\\n\\n5. Weather forecasting: An app that provides farmers with real-time weather forecasts and alerts, helping them make more informed decisions about planting, harvesting, and other activities.\\n\\n6. Market analysis: An app that provides farmers with real-time market data and analysis, helping them make more informed decisions about what crops to grow and when to sell them.\\n\\n7. Sustainable agriculture: An app that helps farmers adopt sustainable agriculture practices, including things like crop rotation, composting, and water conservation.\\n\\n8. Farm management: An app that helps farmers manage their entire farm operation, including things like financial management, equipment maintenance, and employee scheduling.\\n\\n9. Agricultural education: An app that provides farmers with educational resources and training on topics like crop management, soil health, and sustainable agriculture practices.\\n\\n10. Food waste reduction: An app that connects farmers with consumers to reduce food waste by selling surplus crops or imperfect produce that would otherwise go to waste.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/302", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"as software developer i have the following requirement from a customer can you write the outline \\n  A customer visits a coffee shop that sells a bunch of items (e.g. beverages, sandwiches, etc.).\\n  Items have varying tax rates and some are free or offered at a discount when ordered with another item.\\n  The customer is made aware of the order total and once he pays for it, he can wait until notified of the order completion.\\n  You are required to describe a program with a set of interfaces that models the above problem at hand. You need to design the DB and backend architecture and implement it. Front-end is not mandatory but your endpoints should be reachable through Postman (please attach postman collection).\\n  Users should be able to see the list of available items, User should be able to order them and should get a notification after a fixed amount of time that their order is ready.\\n  Unit test cases are not mandatory.\\n  Tech Stack - Ruby on Rails. You can also show us your front-end skills in some JS technologies (React/Angular, etc) or Bootstrap, or plain Html/JS.\\n \\n\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, here is the outline:\\n \\n\\n A Customer can visit a Coffee Shop that sells a variety of beverages and other food items. Each item has a price and may be subject to a varying tax rate, and some items are offered at a discount when ordered along with other items. When the Customer places an order, they are informed of the total price and can pay for the order. Once the order has been paid for, the Customer can wait until they are notified that the order is complete. You are required to design a program with a set of interfaces that models this problem. The program should have a database backend and a web-based frontend, and the frontend should be accessible using the Postman app. The program should allow Users to view a list of available items, order items, and receive a notification when their order is complete. Unit tests are not required. The program should be implemented using Ruby on Rails, and you may also show your front-end skills using some JavaScript technology (such as React or Angular), or using Bootstrap, or using plain HTML/CSS/JS.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncan you create a possible database in MS SQL server for it , please add many tables as you can think of and properties for those tables also the relationships between those tables \\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, here is one possible database design:\\n \\n\\n Table: Customer\\n  - id (primary key)\\n  - name\\n  - email\\n \\n\\n Table: Order\\n  - id (primary key)\\n  - customer_id (foreign key)\\n  - created_at\\n  - total_price\\n \\n\\n Table: Order_Item\\n  - id (primary key)\\n  - order_id (foreign key)\\n  - item_id (foreign key)\\n  - price\\n  - discount\\n  - tax_rate\\n \\n\\n Table: Item\\n  - id (primary key)\\n  - name\\n  - price\\n  - discount\\n  - tax_rate\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncan you think of more fields for each table and add them\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some additional fields that could be added to each table:\\n \\n\\n Table: Customer\\n  - address\\n  - phone_number\\n  - date_of_birth\\n  - gender\\n  - loyalty_points\\n \\n\\n Table: Order\\n  - date_placed\\n  - date_completed\\n  - status (e.g. pending, processing, completed)\\n \\n\\n Table: Order_Item\\n  - quantity\\n  - notes\\n  - item_type (e.g. beverage, sandwich, etc.)\\n \\n\\n Table: Item\\n  - category (e.g. coffee, tea, sandwiches, etc.)\\n  - ingredients\\n  - allergens\\n  - nutritional_information\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/859", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Give me a list of the four different baby names found in America and their origin or meaning. Also, give a French version of the name.\", \"response\": \"Deciding on a name for a baby is not an easy task. Some people prefer family names, while others want something more original. Almost all names come from another word or have a meaning; here is a list of some of them:\\n\\n*   Olivia: A Latin name that comes from the word olive tree. The French version of this name is \\\"Olivie\\\"\\n\\n*   Peter: Peter is a Greek name that means rock or stone. The French version of this name is \\\"Pierre\\\".\\n\\n*   Noah: A Hebrew name coming from the word rest. The French version of this name is \\\"Noé\\\".\\n\\n*   William, A German name that means resolute protector or strong-willed warrior. The French version of this name is \\\"Guillaume\\\".\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
