eration.\\n Negri's ideas, they're just a fad,\\n A temporary trend, not so bad.\\n \\n\\n But let's not forget the truth,\\n The power of the working class, it's so profound.\\n Marx's ideas, they're not passé,\\n They're the foundation, the way to be.\\n \\n\\n Eminem:\\n \\n\\n Negri's ideas, they're not just a trend,\\n They're a revolution, a new way to bend.\\n Marx's vision, it's quite passé,\\n Focusing on the means of production, not the people.\\n \\n\\n Negri's view of the working class,\\n Is not just about exploitation and loss.\\n He sees them as creators, producers,\\n Of value and wealth, not just consumers.\\n \\n\\n 2Pac:\\n \\n\\n Antonio Negri, a name that's hard to forget,\\n A philosopher who's got a lot to bet.\\n But his ideas, they're not so new,\\n They're just a remix, a different view.\\n \\n\\n Marx's vision, it's the foundation,\\n Of the working class, a liberation.\\n Negri's ideas, they're just a fad,\\n A temporary trend, not so bad.\\n \\n\\n But let's not forget the truth,\\n The power of the working class, it's so profound.\\n Marx's ideas, they're not passé,\\n They're the foundation, the way to be.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_f